  "validation": "Two agents independently rechecked the exact retained source lines and reader differences. Separate semantic reviewers checked N2 conditions and U/R argument identity. All rules were authored on exposed data; no blinding, significance, model fit or independent semantic validation claimed. A late bounded U-G extension was separately authored and semantically checked by false_closure_semantics and closure_error_audit; its source triple comes directly from the unchanged parent32-group snapshot.",
  "access": "Bounded existing admitted JSON caches and primary reports only; no new native/photo admission, mixed raw TSV parse,327/336 payload or reserved/sealed material.",
