      "IT f21r.8 fchokshy otor cheol does not supply this exact two-marked-left-argument frame.",
      "IT f102v1.24 ysaiin ckhey qoor cheol also does not supply it; qoor is not silently resegmented.",
      "cheol chol at f24r.18 is retained, with the reader-specific initial grouping difference."
    ],
    "boundary": "Do not universalize the current two-left-expression realization or invent missing arguments and new valencies at each other occurrence. The local construction leaves those uses unparsed. Earlier B2/B3 and C1 decisions remain unchanged.",
    "costs": "Nominal D type, the dy/or roles, two-place cheol, backward binding and local closure are jointly new assumptions chosen with this exposed triple visible. No independent role or word-meaning confirmation.",
    "comparison": "This is an explicit extension of U only. It is not imported into F1 or R to repair their missing bindings. More local coverage does not select U-G as historically true.",
    "profile_account": "Existing cheol profile was retrieved again: ZL139/IT138/RF129 exact prose groups across70/70/68selectors with varied positions and repeats. Its broad use supports no narrow assigned content or universal valency by itself."
